10.112l3.2 3.904z\"><\/path>\n<\/svg><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lskupi97-87d727ff15037fa0fcac79627e3028ff '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" >\r\n<style>\r\n\/* hide featured image pic on top of single post *\/\r\n.big-preview.single-big { display: none; }\r\n.entry-content-header  { display: none; }\r\n.blog-meta { display: none; }\t\r\n.avia-image-container-inner {\r\n\tbox-shadow: 0 4px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);\r\n\twidth: 100%; \r\n}\r\n\/* Create two equal columns that floats next to each other *\/\r\n@media only screen and (min-width: 800px) {\t\r\n\/* Create two equal columns that floats next to each other *\/\r\n.profile-image {\r\n\tfloat: left;\r\n}\r\n.column-1 {\r\n  float: left;\r\n  width: 50%;\r\n  padding: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.column-2 {\r\n  float: left;\r\n  width: 50%;\r\n  padding: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\/* Clear floats after the columns *\/\r\n.row:after {\r\n  content: \"\";\r\n  display: table;\r\n  clear: both;\r\n}}\r\n@media only screen and (max-width: 799px) {\t\r\n\/* Create two equal columns that floats next to each other *\/\r\n.profile-image {\r\n\tfloat: left;\r\n}\r\n.column-1 {\r\n  float: left;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  padding-bottom: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.column-2 {\r\n  float: left;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  padding: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\/* Clear floats after the columns *\/\r\n.row:after {\r\n  content: \"\";\r\n  display: table;\r\n  clear: both;\r\n}}\r\n.template-blog .post_delimiter {\r\n    margin: 0 0 0 0; \r\n    padding: 0 0 0 0; \r\n}\r\n\r\n<\/style>\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"column-1\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n<!-- enfold theme shortcode for opening FI as lightbox image -->\t\t\r\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-kmw1ozg0-906a37c2b167ef2d59740890cad4e6b7\">\n.avia-image-container.av-kmw1ozg0-906a37c2b167ef2d59740890cad4e6b7 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-kmw1ozg0-906a37c2b167ef2d59740890cad4e6b7 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-kmw1ozg0-906a37c2b167ef2d59740890cad4e6b7 av-styling- av-img-linked avia-align-left  publication-image'   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image- avia-img-lazy-loading-not- avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Primer-1030x572.jpeg\" alt='' title=''   itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\"  \/><\/div><\/div><\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\t<div class=\"column-2\">\r\n\t\t<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Primer: Read about why we are captivated by microglia<\/h2>\r\n\t\t<p>Microglia are brain-resident immune cells. One of the many things that makes them special is that, under normal conditions, the brain and the spinal cord are closed off from the immune system. Thus, whereas the rest of our body has many innate and adaptive immune mechanisms for protection, microglia are the primary first responders and defense cells of the brain.<\/p>\n\r\n\r\n<!-- enfold theme shortcode for \"button\" -->\t\t\r\n<div  class='avia-button-wrap av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da-wrap avia-button-left '>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da\">\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da{\nbackground-color:#002569;\nborder-color:#002569;\ncolor:#ffffff;\nborder-radius:30px 30px 30px 30px;\ntransition:all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da:hover{\nbackground-color:#0649b5;\ncolor:#ffffff;\ntransition:all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n}\n#top #wrap_all.avia-button.av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da:hover .avia_button_background{\nborder-radius:30px 30px 30px 30px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da .avia-svg-icon svg:first-child{\nfill:#ffffff;\nstroke:#ffffff;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da:hover .avia-svg-icon svg:first-child{\nfill:#ffffff;\nstroke:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<a href='https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/research\/primer\/'  class='avia-button av-av_button-4d7a2f8eea16788219605275eaa4f7da av-link-btn avia-icon_select-no avia-size-medium avia-position-left'   aria-label=\"Learn More\"><span class='avia_iconbox_title' >Learn More<\/span><\/a><\/div>\r\n\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"column-1\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n<!-- enfold theme shortcode for opening FI as lightbox image -->\t\t\r\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-kmw1ozg0-dbd91d9795371cf3bcf21269ff261020\">\n.avia-image-container.av-kmw1ozg0-dbd91d9795371cf3bcf21269ff261020 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-kmw1ozg0-dbd91d9795371cf3bcf21269ff261020 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-kmw1ozg0-dbd91d9795371cf3bcf21269ff261020 av-styling- av-img-linked avia-align-left  publication-image'   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image- avia-img-lazy-loading-not- avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Lysosome-scaled-e1709561576850-1030x571.jpeg\" alt='' title=''   itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\"  \/><\/div><\/div><\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\t<div class=\"column-2\">\r\n\t\t<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Explore our Lysosomal Biology-Related Projects<\/h2>\r\n\t\t<p>Although multiple cell types are equipped with the ability to perform phagocytosis in invertebrates, in vertebrates, this indispensable task is delegated to the professional phagocytes, including microglia and macrophages. Indeed, it has been shown that circulating monocytes, the progenitors of tissue-resident macrophages, have limited phagocytic capacity, thus indicating that the ability to phagocytose is acquired during development and through differentiation. We are fascinated by multiple open-ended questions in the field of phagocytosis.<\/p>\n\r\n\r\n<!-- enfold theme shortcode for \"button\" -->\t\t\r\n<div  class='avia-button-wrap av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706-wrap avia-button-left '>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706\">\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706{\nbackground-color:#002569;\nborder-color:#002569;\ncolor:#ffffff;\nborder-radius:30px 30px 30px 30px;\ntransition:all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706:hover{\nbackground-color:#0649b5;\ncolor:#ffffff;\ntransition:all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n}\n#top #wrap_all.avia-button.av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706:hover .avia_button_background{\nborder-radius:30px 30px 30px 30px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706 .avia-svg-icon svg:first-child{\nfill:#ffffff;\nstroke:#ffffff;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706:hover .avia-svg-icon svg:first-child{\nfill:#ffffff;\nstroke:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<a href='https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/research\/lysosomal-projects\/'  class='avia-button av-av_button-2b7f7e7030e507f547c570ea595da706 av-link-btn avia-icon_select-no avia-size-medium avia-position-left'   aria-label=\"Learn More\"><span class='avia_iconbox_title' >Learn More<\/span><\/a><\/div>\r\n\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t<div class=\"column-1\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n<!-- enfold theme shortcode for opening FI as lightbox image -->\t\t\r\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-kmw1ozg0-b4e7210af742647bab6cb43a4870edb5\">\n.avia-image-container.av-kmw1ozg0-b4e7210af742647bab6cb43a4870edb5 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-kmw1ozg0-b4e7210af742647bab6cb43a4870edb5 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-kmw1ozg0-b4e7210af742647bab6cb43a4870edb5 av-styling- av-img-linked avia-align-left  publication-image'   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image- avia-img-lazy-loading-not- avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Microglia-and-brain-disorders-scaled-e1709561534850-1030x571.jpeg\" alt='' title=''   itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\"  \/><\/div><\/div><\/div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\t<div class=\"column-2\">\r\n\t\t<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Delve into our research on Microglia and Brain Disorders<\/h2>\r\n\t\t<p>As the primary defense, immune, and phagocytic cells in the brain, microglia govern multiple aspects of brain development, repair, and aging. In recent years, there has been an increasing appreciation of the contributions of microglia in neurodegenerative, neurodevelopmental, and neuropsychiatric disorders. In particular, the aberrant activation and resolution of microglial responses have been linked to the pathology observed in sporadic or late-onset Alzheimer\u2019s disease. Although genome-wide association studies have revealed a number of genes potentially associated with increased risk of Alzheimer\u2019s disease, and enriched in microglia, large-scale functional analyses of these genes have not been performed to date.<\/p>\n\r\n\r\n<!-- enfold theme shortcode for \"button\" -->\t\t\r\n<div  class='avia-button-wrap av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7-wrap avia-button-left '>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7\">\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7{\nbackground-color:#002569;\nborder-color:#002569;\ncolor:#ffffff;\nborder-radius:30px 30px 30px 30px;\ntransition:all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7:hover{\nbackground-color:#0649b5;\ncolor:#ffffff;\ntransition:all 0.4s ease-in-out;\n}\n#top #wrap_all.avia-button.av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7:hover .avia_button_background{\nborder-radius:30px 30px 30px 30px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7 .avia-svg-icon svg:first-child{\nfill:#ffffff;\nstroke:#ffffff;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .avia-button.av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7:hover .avia-svg-icon svg:first-child{\nfill:#ffffff;\nstroke:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<a href='https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/research\/microglia-and-brain-disorders\/'  class='avia-button av-av_button-93710deace1d727e3d6582abe42eadd7 av-link-btn avia-icon_select-no avia-size-medium avia-position-left'   aria-label=\"Learn More\"><span class='avia_iconbox_title' >Learn More<\/span><\/a><\/div>\r\n\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<\/div><\/section>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-437","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/iyerlaboratory.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/437","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/iyer